ey don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":24,"line":"At the grave, Francisco, Liam speak for Linda — \"Earl trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":24,"line":"Grayson hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Francisco brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Francisco brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":27,"line":"⛓️ Francisco brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":27,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1600 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":31,"line":"Donated Burdock (+3330 kcal). Trust +3. They'll remember this."},{"day":32,"line":"At the grave, Grayson, Ethan, Mia and 1 more speak for Francisco — \"Linda trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":33,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":33,"line":"You accept Thornfield's food — 2,041 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Theo clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,6