)"},{"day":1,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Diplomatic Incident (Level 1). Trust builds 2x faster. You're TOO good though — once per week you can start a diplomatic incident: villagers argue, you pick the winner (+trust with them, -trust with the loser)."},{"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 40s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 40s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 40s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 40s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 30s, with restless hands looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 30s, with restless hands looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 30s, with restless hands shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 30s, with restless hands says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"Gabriel looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 30s, with restless hands says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"Village meal: +1015 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the north ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":3,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Gabriel says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Gabriel shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too