erything from here is earned."},{"day":25,"line":"Village meal: +1011 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Eoghan brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🍖 The feast is warm and good — full bellies, loud laughter — but no keepsake was channeled. The surge must be armed before a feast can carry it: hold a keepsake and channel first. (Feast buff refused: devotion gate.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"Village meal: +1050 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the north. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":30,"line":"You give Emberhold 1,750 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Peter weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":30,"line":"Gabriel counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"2 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":30,"line":"Village meal: +1070 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":31,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":31,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the north. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":32,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":33,"line":"Gabriel counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"0 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":33,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":34,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":35,"line":"⛓️ Eoghan brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":35,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":35,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":36,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":36,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":37,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":38,"line":"✨ Ability gained: Loud Chewer (L1). Eating is 2x louder (monsters hear you). But villagers love eating beside you: trust builds 10% faster."},{"day":38,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":39,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":40,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":41,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"d