 this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":78,"line":"Donated American Persimmon (+520 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":78,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the north. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":79,"line":"🔥 Jamie, at the fire: \"It wears our faces? Then we don't trust faces after dark.\""},{"day":79,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":80,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Generous Heart (Level 1). Donating gives 2x trust."},{"day":80,"line":"At the grave, Gabriel, Jamie, Elena and 3 more speak for Ajinkya — \"Eoghan trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":80,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the north. They carried off ~1000 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":83,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":83,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 1,624 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Aisha clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":84,"line