,{"day":4,"line":"Tom hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Tom hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Village meal: +1077 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Tom hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Tom hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the north ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A runner from Ashford, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Kennedy hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Kennedy hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1077 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Kennedy counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"0 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"day":11,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +1150 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":13,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":13,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~600 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Village meal: +1400 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":16,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":17,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":18,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":19,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":20,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":20,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":21,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":21,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1400 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":22,"line":"Village meal: +1093 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":23,"line":"✨ Ability gained: Loud Chewer (L1). Eating is 2x louder (monsters hear you). But villagers love eating beside you: trust builds 10% faster."},{"day":23,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":24,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Tom brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":25,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Tom brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"⛓️ Catalina brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":27,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":28,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":28,"line":"You accept Thornfield's food — 2,421 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Hana clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":30,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":30,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the north. They carried off ~1200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":31,"line":"Village meal: +1001 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":32,"line":"Village meal: +102