rganization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"Village meal: +1007 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":27,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+3575 kcal). Trust +5. They'll remember this."},{"day":27,"line":"You give Emberhold 1,500 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Darius weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":27,"line":"⛓️ Camila brings it home: The Hungry Road bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":27,"line":"Village meal: +1058 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"A runner from The Hungry Road, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways