istens."},{"day":80,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":80,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 1,696 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Sanne clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":80,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":80,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Hungry Road came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":80,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Red Table came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":81,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~912 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":81,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~936 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":81,"line":"⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Deep Read! You don't just read trust — you read intent. Know what they'll do next. (Your knowledge of Reading People amplifies your open_book.)"},{"day":82,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":82,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Hungry Road came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~1600 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":83,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+130 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":83,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~600 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":84,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from The Hungry Road turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":85,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+390 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":85,"line":"Donated Muscadine Grapes (+180 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":86,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+520 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":89,"line":"At the grave, Ricardo, Yudai, Uraiwan and 4 more speak for Ella — \"Tom trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":90,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck The Hungry Road in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":90,"line":"◈ Ella Johnson walks out of the light alone, which is how she walked in — and the galaxy, which came to watch a monster, leaves afraid of the right things. The fear is a shield now, held over a village that trusts the hand that holds it."}],"callLines":[],"heraldAttempts":[],"musterRefusals":[],"musterCalls":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0},"musterErrs":0,"musterErrors":[],"instrumentErrors":[],"maxWave":4,"wave4"