":"Ada hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Village meal: +1020 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A woman, maybe 60s, with grey-streaked hair shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A woman, maybe 60s, with grey-streaked hair says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Sandra shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":8,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Generous Heart (Level 1). Donating gives 2x trust."},{"day":8,"line":"⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Deep Read! You don't just read trust — you read intent. Know what they'll do next. (Your knowledge of Reading People amplifies your open_book.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Dominic hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Andriy: \"It offered me something. A... gift? I said no. I don't trust gifts from the sky.\""},{"day":10,"line":"Dominic hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Dominic hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Dominic hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Shynar hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":11,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Shynar hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Shynar hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Andriy counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"0 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":15,"line":"Owen hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Dominic counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"0 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":17,"line":"Owen hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":17,"line":"Dominic counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":17,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1400 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":18,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1264 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":20,"line":"At the grave, Shynar, Rosa speak for Dominic — \"Ada trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":24,"line":"At the grave, Shynar speaks for Rosa — \"Dominic trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":25,"line":"💛 You hold Notebook. Route optimizations, glitch lists, apocalypse patch notes. 'DO NOT TRUST THE CACHE BY THE RIVER.' Your magnum opus, half-finished. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)"},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Andriy brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":25,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the mess