line":"A person, maybe 30s, with thick glasses looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1007 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":7,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 30s, with thick glasses says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A person, maybe 30s, with thick glasses looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A person, maybe 30s, with thick glasses looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1228 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A runner from Ashford, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Chris looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":8,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Chris says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Chris shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1040 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Chris shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":9,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Chris says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Chris looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1037 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Chris looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Chris looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Village meal: +1403 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +1008 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Chris hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Chris hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Alex counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"2 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +1229 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":15,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":15,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~1381 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":19,"line":"Owen counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"0 for guilty. 4 against.\""},{"day":20,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":22,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Leo brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Leo brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":29,"line":"⛓️ Leo brings it home: The Hungry Road II bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":29,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":29,"line":"A runner from The Bloodied, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":29,"line":"A runner from The Hungry Road, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":30,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+3575 kcal). Trust +9. They'll remember this."},{"day":30,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to The Hungry Road II's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":31,"line":"At the grave, Ashanti, Marcus, Owen and 1 more speak for Ekaterina — \"Emma trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":31,"line":"You give Emberhold 1,500 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Nora weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":31,"line":"A runner from The Hungry Road II, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":32,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":32,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":35,"line":"At the grave, Ashanti, Owen, Raj and 1 more speak for Marcus — \"Ekaterina trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from Stonebridge this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +4,000 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":36,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":37,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~1000 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":37,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1369 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":38,"line":"Seven days of silence, and the silence answered for Haven. Emberhold's new speaker reads it plainly. (Trust -6.)"},{"day":38,"line":"Seven days of silence, and the silence answered for Haven. Stonebridge's new speaker reads it plainly. (Trust -6.)"},{"day":38,"line":"Seven days of silence, and the silence answered for Haven. The Hungry Road II's new speaker reads it plainly. (Trust -6.)"},{"day":40,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Red Table came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":41,"line":"You give Stonebridge 1,664 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Dmitri weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":41,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at t